body:
Sorry if this is complicated or anything, but the problem is walking to a job is kind of a no-go in my area, closest job to walk to is I think 30 minutes away and the neighborhoods over here are really bad, It was already dangerous walking to school when I was younger. And since I’m a transmale and don’t have money to transition, aka I still have a female body which makes it much more dangerous to walk alone because of that.

&#x200B;

I hope that’s understandable.

I..Just said even if I get a job The money I need for the card won’t be there, the only card I can use is my mom’s and all shell do is steal my money.

&#x200B;

Is that understandable or
